The plugin contracts, lifecycle runtime, VS Code adapter, and basic WXML
language service in this project are a separate implementation.

The style indexing and navigation design was informed by vscode/src/styles.ts
in the reference project. The CSS module is implemented with explicit workspace,
definition, and template-class resolver interfaces and includes CSS custom
property navigation.

The WXML script navigation design was informed by vscode/src/scripts.ts,
vscode/src/wxml.ts and vscode/src/language.ts in the reference project.
The script resolver is a separate implementation using the TypeScript compiler
API, an in-memory workspace host, and the ScriptDefinitionResolver interface.

